On-device AI Coach model (downloaded at first run — NOT redistributed by NOOP)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The optional on-device AI Coach runs Meta's Llama 3.2 3B Instruct. NOOP does NOT
bundle or redistribute the model weights: the repository and app contain only a
pinned download URL + SHA-256 (see Strand/AI/OnDevice/ModelCatalog.swift), and the
device fetches the weights directly from Hugging Face on first run, at the user's
request.

